!! Changelog

!!! Upstream filesystem adaptor integration

Removed TidGi's forked filesystem adaptor, watcher, reverse index, retry implementation and external-attachment migration code.

TidGi now injects dynamic-store declarations through the upstream in-memory `wikiInfo`/`filesInfo` API, provides `nsfw` through the upstream watcher-provider interface, and handles application side effects through upstream filesystem hooks.

The remaining routing utilities explain TidGi workspace concepts to the UI; they do not perform filesystem operations.
